{"type":"assistant","uuid":"c1d33c8a-c20d-4b0b-9358-49fab1d61bff","session_id":"0866928d-1f69-4d63-9fb7-28f449073c40","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"c1d33c8a-c20d-4b0b-9358-49fab1d61bff","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI've identified and fixed the bug in the AnkiDroid Card Browser's multi-select mode when changing note types.\n\n### Root Cause\nWhen multiple cards from different notes were selected in the Card Browser and the user clicked \"Edit\" to change the note type:\n1. The \"Edit\" menu item was only visible when all selected cards belonged to a **single note** (via `hasSelectedSingleNoteId()`)\n2. When multiple notes were selected, the user couldn't change the note type at all\n3. Even when a single note was selected, only one card was opened in the note editor\n\n### Fix Applied (4 files modified)\n\n**1. `AnkiDroid/src/main/java/com/ichi2/anki/CardBrowser.java`**\n- Added `mTargetModelId` field to store the selected target model\n- Changed the \"Edit\" button visibility from `hasSelectedSingleNoteId()` to `hasSelectedCards()` so it shows for any selection\n- Added logic: if single note selected → open note editor; if multiple notes → show model selection dialog\n- Added `showChangeModelDialog()` to display a dialog listing all available note types\n- Added `executeChangeModelCollectionTask()` to perform the batch change via CollectionTask\n- Added `mChangeModelHandler` to handle the result (success with undo snackbar, or error toast)\n\n**2. `AnkiDroid/src/main/java/com/ichi2/async/CollectionTask.java`**\n- Added `CHANGE_MODEL_MULTI` case in `doInBackgroundDismissNotes()` that:\n  - Gets unique notes from selected cards\n  - Builds identity field mapping (field N → field N) and card mapping\n  - Calls `col.getModels().change()` with all note IDs\n  - Handles `ConfirmModSchemaException` gracefully\n  - Stores undo information\n\n**3. `AnkiDroid/src/main/java/com/ichi2/libanki/Collection.java`**\n- Added `CHANGE_MODEL_MULTI` to `DismissType` enum\n- Added undo handling for `CHANGE_MODEL_MULTI` that restores original field values and regenerates cards\n- Added `markUndo` support to save undo information\n\n**4. `AnkiDroid/src/main/res/values/` (resource files)**\n- Added `undo_action_change_model_multi` string for undo label\n- Added `changed_model_message` string for success toast\n- Added `card_browser_change_note_type` string for dialog title\n\n### Result\n- Users can now select cards from **multiple notes** in the browser\n- Clicking \"Edit\" shows a dialog listing all available note types\n- Selecting a note type applies it to **all selected notes** via batch operation\n- Full undo support via the undo snackbar"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":104984,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":104544,"total_tokens":105579}}}
